writeExplanation.prompt:
Write a complete explanation of {concept} using ONLY the language and concepts of {target_domain}.

Analogy mapping:
{analogies}

Rules:
- Never use jargon from {source_domain} — translate everything
- Tell it as a story or scenario in {target_domain}
- Build up from simple parts to the full system
- End with 'Back in {source_domain} terms...' — a one-paragraph bridge that maps back

Make it vivid, memorable, and fun to read. Someone who knows {target_domain} but nothing about {source_domain} should understand {concept} after reading this.

{training_explanation}
